  "description": "“Let’s make this ruined world think it’s a game.” \n\nKim Jin-woo, a game director, is one day summoned as the otherworlder “Arsilan.” After a life of fierce struggle, Arsilan has reached the realm of an archmage—but his world now stands on the brink of destruction because of entities called “Erosions.” Only Jin-woo, who came from Earth, is immune to Erosion. Yet even as an archmage, a single person can’t face countless Erosions alone within a mere three years. \n\n“I just want to let go of everything and rest now.” \n\nAt the very moment he gives up and empties his heart, Jin-woo transcends and becomes a Transcendent. With that, he gains an absolute authority: the “Gate of Souls.” Through the Gate of Souls, he can now travel back and forth between Earth and Arsilan. He uses this power to summon Earthlings—who are also immune to Erosion—into Arsilan via the Gate, making them believe it’s all just a game and sending them to fight the Erosions. \n\nThus begins the so‑called “Arsilan Saga Project,” in which a worn-out game director-turned-transcendent turns a dying world into a “game” scenario and mobilizes players from Earth to save it.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12573206)\n\n**Original Webtoon**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852339), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14367980)",
